{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_title", "source_sha256": "9867b31daa8e62943c6317b4a4014444e4775c821b6ac8eedd822c9fd8c779ff", "ja": "いつかあなたとパーティーを", "zh": "总有一天要与你共赴派对", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_synopsis", "source_sha256": "336cb48f5dbbcb1aff1c5234a4c3fa27492f7919594f6009dca756495217a0b4", "ja": "まつりの新曲ステージの参考にしようと、\n縁日にやってくるメンバー。迷子の女の子に\nお姫様と呼ばれたまつりは、また会いたいと\n願う彼女に「劇場でいつでも会えるよ」と\n告げ、皆を楽しませるステージへと向かう。", "zh": "为了给茉莉的新歌舞台找寻灵感，\n大家一起来到了庙会。被走失的小女孩\n唤作公主的茉莉，对希望再次相见的\n小女孩说“在剧场随时都能见到哦”，\n随后迈向了让大家都能开怀欢笑的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f5e8985d31af0e056b5f0d380b48fe9c4f004ded7341a940b297a99ac5f6c0df", "ja": "（まつり達と一緒に、お祭り会場に来てみた。\nこれは……想像より、かなり賑わってるな……！）", "zh": "（和茉莉她们一起来到了祭典会场。这里……比想象中热闹多了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "fa1d98d4e67967ce06523ddee37afd8090e4942d37390c96cab175e16fde05ad", "ja": "屋台、めっちゃ充実してますやん！　たこ焼きに、\nお好み焼きに……あかん、めっちゃお腹空いてきた！", "zh": "小吃摊这也太丰富了吧！章鱼烧、\n大阪烧……不行了，肚子超级饿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "f23c2ed8bbe08939e9d1499a2073440285ab57f372fd6215946d3dbd36168049", "ja": "屋台の食べ物もいいけど、それより……奈緒やん！\nせっかくだし、茜ちゃんとひと勝負してみない？", "zh": "摊位上的小吃虽然好，但比起那个……奈绪！\n难得来一趟，要不要和小茜来比一场？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "6588cb55af4be62a1fd2be9463f21197f72d16b4ec3492b22b6e34767be40744", "ja": "狙った獲物は外さない、『必中の茜ちゃん』……\n景品のぬいぐるみを賭けて、射的で勝負だ～！", "zh": "瞄准的猎物绝不落空——“必中之小茜”……  \n就拿奖品毛绒玩偶来赌一把，比比射击吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "3a8b73db7e32bb202586587c44eb69fcbf5a36350a558515f860c937840d39b0", "ja": "私を指名してくるとは、自信がありそうやな……茜！\nよっしゃ、勝負や！　後悔しても知らんで！", "zh": "居然点名让我来，看来你很有自信嘛……茜！好，来决胜负！输了可别后悔啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1f0332bc0690c78fe64973de65dc38ac5af5cab0d54f25a2ee20df58063e6480", "ja": "ふたりとも、人が多いから気をつけて！\n……って、聞こえてないか。", "zh": "你们两个，周围人很多，小心点！\n……不过，应该听不见吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "e08b0125dce365c841fdc1be49c09e6cb592a178702d281654d3e447d9556584", "ja": "ふふっ。茜ちゃんと奈緒ちゃんは、\n元気いっぱいなのです。", "zh": "呵呵，小茜和奈绪都活力满满呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "f93572c6ea40bcc49ccb12ea1d876bda9b2255c598297490731c6717eab009a8", "ja": "姫は、お祭りを見学しながら\n新曲と公演について考えてみるのです。", "zh": "公主打算一边参观祭典，\n一边思考新曲和演出相关的事情哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ad29b2bc16e6f88735d3c81effa6cf8e46373da8de787abb610fa4ef9d578c10", "ja": "そうだな。千早と百合子も、良かったら協力してくれ。\n何か思いついたら言って欲しい。", "zh": "是啊。千早和百合子，如果可以的话，也请你们帮帮忙。想到什么点子就告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "9c9a8b2861f8613eb58ec6915eb7c225fb6a19d7ce3f403d50eba1dfda29d461", "ja": "あっ！　私、ひとつアイディアがあるんです。新曲に、\n和の世界観を取り入れてみるというのはどうでしょう？", "zh": "啊！我有一个想法。要不要试着在新歌中融入和风的世界观？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "f738c82a95b11f0da8983bab619004704ea6d60a61972fa1f042359e1c776b58", "ja": "和の世界観？", "zh": "和风的世界观？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "18fb883af4276c0f09cfea4f7aafd2e5b24d1bd232dcc594fd0ba4ae5044c2bd", "ja": "はい！　『Charlotte・Charlotte』で、\nまつりさんは西洋風のお姫様をやってたから……。", "zh": "是的！在《Charlotte・Charlotte》中，\nまつり小姐饰演的是西洋风格的公主，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "baae1f357c1483b0ee44fd454855b25563e03f6761fc847c6f4240a631ca8aa6", "ja": "和風のお姫様姿も、見てみたいなって思ったんです！", "zh": "所以我就想，要是能看到和风的公主模样就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "1803fde6158651dbef646bb8027361820966a6458e1e2b0594cb39744cd43278", "ja": "ふむふむ、和風のお姫様……\nなんだか新しい可能性を秘めているのです！", "zh": "嗯嗯，和风公主……\n总觉得其中蕴藏着全新的可能性呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "1a1506c62e7f4cf8d162c3a555498530e342b7b80576b7467d4ab75fba9de378", "ja": "素敵なアイディアね。それなら徳川さん、\nこの後のメインステージを見学してみませんか？", "zh": "真是个不错的主意。那样的话，德川小姐，\n要不要去参观一下之后的主舞台？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "40d572f07fbb00fe79a98a6eb2cdc43292c17d626f7184fe21cc019bd795a7e2", "ja": "民謡大会があるそうなんです。\n私、民謡には少し覚えがあるので。", "zh": "听说有民谣大会。\n我对民谣稍微有些了解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "06c2a55a87a64bf540af92dcd6f308599f0b366fd44a1320eb404aa8d03c7b3f", "ja": "千早ちゃん……斬新なアイディアなのです！\nその意見、いただきなのです♪", "zh": "千早……这个想法真新颖！\n这个意见，我就收下啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f240a9c82c135a45a946aecc6a101c313f07080c5ca72a335738250d2f534fe6", "ja": "早速、色んなアイディアが出てきたな！\n……おっと、奈緒と茜が戻ってきたみたいだ。", "zh": "这么快就冒出各种各样的点子了！\n……哎呀，奈绪和茜好像回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "8321dfce1916f42ea6b39ee761dd87c17727d1b3b5d9a808d610ebc9b41b3ece", "ja": "茜、なかなかやるやん！　景品のお菓子は山分けな♪\n……あれ？　みんな、まだここにいたんです？", "zh": "茜，你还真行啊！奖品里的点心就平分吧♪\n……咦？大家还在这里啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1019_p", "source_sha256": "96c8b23da8400a3cd03b006c49c2151e3625d3cc35413de0d33677387d62dbe7", "ja": "ああ。新曲のアイディア出しをしてたんだ。\n奈緒と茜も、何か参考になりそうなものはあったか？", "zh": "啊。刚才在想新歌的创意。\n奈绪和茜，你们有没有找到什么可以参考的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "28f0a03ff5da6bc7a9fde8135d5747d9fc43ebbb73dd14fe7092371f571931c0", "ja": "おっと、そうだった！　まつりちゃんの新曲だよね！\n茜ちゃん、忘れてないよ？", "zh": "哎呀，对哦！是小松莉的新歌嘛！小茜，我可没忘哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "2fcbfb99d8102dc0aa8a7e54c313b9fdad18a4b0cd28afd9d95aaee3f2939705", "ja": "せやなぁ。曲のラストに、打ち上げ花火とか\nええんちゃう？　会場もめっちゃ盛り上がるで！", "zh": "是啊。歌曲最后放一场烟花什么的，  \n不是挺好的吗？现场也会超级热闹哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "dd1fb3059cfeb1287509c11f3dbd1b6497d1e8870c338a666fae3e1ca6ccd113", "ja": "いやいやいや！　ライブを盛り上げるなら、\nここはカワイイ着ぐるみ一択！　でしょ？", "zh": "不不不！要让演唱会热闹起来，\n这里当然只能选可爱的吉祥物服装！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "68567af456d5d101b59e504a661f82437dd39b72ecc472c51f206a36d503d0ac", "ja": "新商品の『まつりちゃん人形』と合わせて、\n新曲のステージで初お披露目！っていうのはどう？", "zh": "配合新商品“祭典公主玩偶”，在新歌的舞台上首次公开亮相！这个主意怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "302eb87332e1c00f05a495f7d7d532f489faeff397b9421a77e7806c76944949", "ja": "姫も、花火は大好きなのです！\nそれに、着ぐるみは盲点だったのです。", "zh": "公主也很喜欢烟花哦！\n而且，人偶装确实让人意想不到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "3c661531677f2f2758338fc29b700f1aa3d957c3f05b5d83fabf3dcdefae7039", "ja": "和風、民謡、花火……グッズを使った演出……。\nうーん、何がよろこんでもらえるのです……？", "zh": "和风、民谣、烟花……还有利用周边的演出……\n唔——怎样才能让大家开心呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7f7a8d93ad26567dac0c99da27f3c21cc8367e694fb8bc1a44a406638ac6ad4f", "ja": "（ん？　……さっきから人の意見を聞くばかりで、\nまつり自身は何も意見を言わないな……）", "zh": "（嗯？……从刚才开始就只是在听别人的意见，\n祭自己却什么意见都没提啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "c6063a675962102aa50af0342fb063541a236b2dce8c8e912206429de69bbaba", "ja": "まつりちゃん、煮詰まってきちゃった？　そういう\n時は……みんなで、綿あめでも食べながら考えよー！", "zh": "茉莉，脑子转不动了吗？遇到这种\n时候……不如大家一起边吃棉花糖边想吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa089d909cb4d7caf02f9b270fa07d0893f9aaae307e8c626359878d4736303a", "ja": "そうですね！　甘いものは、脳が働くといいますし。\n{$P$}さん、いいですか？", "zh": "没错！都说甜食能让大脑运转得更快。{$P$}先生，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1029_p", "source_sha256": "21c17a24bdb7ff0df96e09ca681f93021f02a1412dc6fc6588957c0732eb14cb", "ja": "そうだな。アイディア出しはいったん置いて、\n自由行動にしよう。みんな、楽しんできてくれ！", "zh": "是啊。先把想点子放一放，大家自由行动吧。都好好玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
