{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1034_p", "source_sha256": "99593e56812981f2c45dcf79e6891432d9e1b89e8a1a8cd58e60f28320d0c2da", "ja": "聞いた人みんなが、ハッピーになるような曲……\nまつりはそう言ってたな。だとしたら……う～ん。", "zh": "能让所有听到的人都感到幸福的歌曲……真理是这么说的。要是这样的话……嗯——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "41d679290284894f28a29ca3f38985cb135ff73ac158e284ce8faf87666e222f", "ja": "お疲れ様なのです、{$P$}さん。\nまつりのことを呼んだのです？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n是在叫玛茨莉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a81d68ee4211c17bedf3b36ffa7a4876d2e4ed318a022f0eefa281157fcb953d", "ja": "あれ、まつり？\nみんなと遊びに行ったんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "咦，茉莉？\n你不是和大家一起出去玩了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "d6a3b757162ff31d362d078bbd55d91e9e9364ef9da773767186dba1ef3fcf4d", "ja": "そう思ったのですけど、その前に休憩なのです。\n姫は、ポップコーンを買ってきたのです！", "zh": "我是这么想的，不过在那之前先休息一下。\n公主买了爆米花回来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "70c401584ddad5220030c0ea3b5ef837dd63cb8d2f6f228e96e90fed50991dcf", "ja": "キャラメル味、とってもおいしいのです～。\n{$P$}さんも、おひとつどうぞ♪", "zh": "焦糖味的，特别好吃呢～\n{$P$}先生也请尝一个吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1039_p", "source_sha256": "050dc08d61cab94153fa8086d99c22e38ccb4e5b758f7ea8ed0dd8c5879921fa", "ja": "ありがとう、いただくよ。\n……なあ、まつり。ちょっと気になったんだけど。", "zh": "谢谢你，那我就不客气了。\n……我说，茉莉。我有点在意一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1040_p", "source_sha256": "7ed2fa60880ad6e5526c173614c66633b87b32ebb948cb1d640eb0f7971b6b3d", "ja": "さっき、みんなと話している時……聞くだけで、\nあまり自分の意見を言ってなかったな。どうしてだ？", "zh": "刚才和大家聊天的时候……你只是听着，似乎没怎么说自己的意见。为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "2771ea32a7b308b91f06df6f69dacbbacf8184201013b838cf399e2b20edf44a", "ja": "ほ……。{$P$}さんは、\n姫のことをよく見ているのですね。", "zh": "哦……{$P$}先生很关注公主呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1042_021mat", "source_sha256": "06804f901ae319acd40d0280cbcb470edfd45283e2489e33138a11b6675efc38", "ja": "姫は今回、大勢のみんなと……姫の歌を聞いたことが\nない人でも楽しめる、そんな公演にしたいのです。", "zh": "公主这次，想办一场能让许许多多的人……\n就算是没听过公主唱歌的人，也能乐在其中的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1043_021mat", "source_sha256": "2b3fbab3f9020536fb42e3cf31a439248965bae68c295273525974f1e108fa50", "ja": "……でもそれには、いつもの姫じゃ、\nダメみたいなのです。だから。", "zh": "……可是这样一来，只靠平时的公主，好像还不行。所以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1044_p", "source_sha256": "3ce1c638d875c32ebd060e5c034c0c8e3711ef39357e633f221aa0d8494cdf41", "ja": "だから、他の人の意見を重視してるってことか。\n妹さんは……その、観に来てくれそうか？", "zh": "所以，你是说自己很重视其他人的意见吗？妹妹她……那个，会来看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "65fe7f303fa5361043e4a67cb381857485921029ec532ea2b5062ac4f521ebdc", "ja": "それは、姫にもわからないのです。", "zh": "那个，姬也不知道哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1046_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1047_021mat", "source_sha256": "c8237bdf328cb261dfef8d71a673650af3bd12046f9974f833cf073080c53f3c", "ja": "{$P$}さん。まつり、\nお祭りを歩いていて、すこし思い出したのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。茉莉在祭典上走着走着，想起了一些事情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1048_021mat", "source_sha256": "d62a23e151cb3fc0352eec11d50b047f2cfaf8d3dace1721771b17ff6fe3c4b6", "ja": "小さいころ、妹と手を繋いで屋台を見て歩いたのです。\n妹はずっと笑ってて……まつりも、楽しかったのです。", "zh": "小时候，茉莉牵着妹妹的手，边看摊位边走着。\n妹妹一直在笑……茉莉也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "96eee04f02243614a27642daa75bcf47cec03eb07fd8b1bf8ae2aee02337b424", "ja": "だから、お祭りみたいに楽しいステージができたら。\n……妹は、笑ってくれるかもしれないって思うのです。", "zh": "所以，如果能带来像庆典一样欢乐的舞台就好了。\n……我想，妹妹或许也会露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1050_p", "source_sha256": "7c3840634e7ae23e17928a6af10ea29206efafd2dc234b452272ad436ce60c5e", "ja": "まつり……。\nけど、だったら尚更……。", "zh": "茉莉……。\n但要是这样，那就更应该……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1051_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "c7e63b7ae2076f0d4a9e2d8460d5082fb7ee2a481f9ad6646aa9a3a0c1fdf9e1", "ja": "ぐすっ……。おねえちゃん、どこ……？", "zh": "抽泣……姐姐，你在哪里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1052_p", "source_sha256": "1f5ed25d4d2a787a584847daa26c58aca4a9d9f7e837440ed95337b38edf2783", "ja": "ん？　女の子が泣いてる。\n迷子かな？", "zh": "嗯？有个小女孩在哭。\n是迷路了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1053_021mat", "source_sha256": "ad35f1351ca7ace7f14c5954f1b23625e2776111de87f6c86285d3e4461914f5", "ja": "大変なのです！　姫におまかせなのです！", "zh": "大事不好了！就交给本公主吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1054_p", "source_sha256": "be5f8b2f8054a1f8e10b9713c0a3dbf90cf6deeeaa11966f51f9602a3ab422a7", "ja": "あ、まつり！？", "zh": "啊，真里！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1055_021mat", "source_sha256": "38fc5c5bc589518618fcc6b18798ba957b9aa85af0acccc350396743ecbf2494", "ja": "こんにちは、小さなお姫様！\n悲しそうな顔をして、どうしたの？", "zh": "你好，小公主！\n怎么愁眉苦脸的，是遇到什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1056_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "1f17ca6fd3dc71dbd2221f30214099c83c42fc7a344f6cf495d4a6621723c0f9", "ja": "……ぐすっ。あのね……金魚さん見てたら、\nおねえちゃんいなくなっちゃった……。", "zh": "……呜呜。那个……我看金鱼的时候，\n姐姐不见了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1057_p", "source_sha256": "ca8d2cf0b2592b8ed83e4be1b66a0bda06344de6717f501db66d0b36e4d71c88", "ja": "やっぱり、迷子みたいだな。お姉さんを\n探しながら、案内所まで連れていってあげよう。", "zh": "果然是迷路了啊。我们一边找\n你的姐姐，一边送你去问讯处吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1058_021mat", "source_sha256": "5cbf9043c6c821090fc43da1db7bc7cd883dc0671dc8259adda7d31ba4caba03", "ja": "はいなのです。それじゃあ、おててを繋ぐのです。\n姫たちといっしょに、お姉ちゃん探しに出発なのです！", "zh": "好的哦！那我们牵手手吧。和公主们一起出发去找姐姐吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1059_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "f19b7e696851226a0bbfc4c5854c0bdfa8b870d60a54e6c871a40aa8fd730dd4", "ja": "ぐすっ……うん……。", "zh": "抽泣……嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1060_021mat", "source_sha256": "8b96426fdd2c67823733c152fe6dc97547b0d6e46e03fdba30810ac1b041b794", "ja": "姫たちが一緒だから、きっと見つかるのです！\n……だからもう、泣かなくて大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "有本公主在，一定能找到的！\n……所以别哭了，已经没事啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1061_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "68d20eb3cf615aae8eaf1f475103e539b2970c89892b944b82bf45c9c1e824c6", "ja": "おひめさま……？\nおねえちゃん、おひめさまなの？", "zh": "公主……？\n姐姐是公主吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1062_021mat", "source_sha256": "1924539051afc3d08cd3f2e7527abee27b697d380c8574e5752cf408919a8107", "ja": "そのとおりなのです。\nまつりは、本物のお姫様なのですよ♪", "zh": "正是如此。\n玛茨莉是真正的公主哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1063_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "7ae30074d1c0c3cf7e71f8a9339a2880b0d04deabbf0d66d6d55183e612317e6", "ja": "わあ～……本物のおひめさま、はじめてみた！\nだからおねえちゃんは、キラキラしてるんだね！", "zh": "哇～……我第一次见到真正的公主！\n所以大姐姐才会闪闪发光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1064_021mat", "source_sha256": "880ea4e4e1fd43a05582b5bc126f16838d5210996e0ddf54b3187870766181f6", "ja": "ほ……？　姫が、キラキラ……ですか？", "zh": "哦……？公主，闪闪发光……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1065_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "105a814e713f7b2ebef97200306d97bb4a66f07f5d4b9aae23169f90784022cc", "ja": "うんっ！　すっごくキラキラしてるよ！\n本物のおひめさまって、すごいんだね！", "zh": "嗯！闪闪发光的！\n真正的公主好厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1067_p", "source_sha256": "c728d893d231b8a5614bc96e6421222badf030d17618ff1b3045146a4d2c02c9", "ja": "まつり、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "小祭，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1068_021mat", "source_sha256": "47f3c44584a7c3fc96c2fa97f83d567a22859c0541f2b7302612d3eaa819bfb0", "ja": "小さい頃、妹とこんなふうに手を繋いで歩いたのです。\n妹といっしょに……パレードの、お姫様を見て……。", "zh": "小时候，我也像这样牵着妹妹的手走过呢。\n和妹妹一起……看着游行里的公主殿下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1069_021mat", "source_sha256": "b9aeef41d2cc94d5748d62a7db4085478f6b795a56efa88a11e409e08f963817", "ja": "お姉ちゃんなら……なれるよって……。", "zh": "姐姐的话……一定能成为公主的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1070_p", "source_sha256": "2e6e2f5fdbb9b0d95c367d8f800059dec3e3bcf50dd6b52631d1e3ea3f90336d", "ja": "そうか。……この子にとって、今のまつりは、\nちゃんとお姫様に見えてるみたいだな。", "zh": "这样啊。……对这孩子来说，现在的茉莉，似乎真的就是公主呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1071_021mat", "source_sha256": "c8aff33d60cb28e39633be5b35925408c657b54aba5811f7ffe5ceb27636b0e9", "ja": "……ふふっ。当然なのです。だってまつりは、\n生まれた時からずっと……ずっと、姫なのです！", "zh": "……呵呵，当然啦。因为小祭从出生那一刻起……一直、一直都是公主哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1072_p", "source_sha256": "9c2ac370850f67fbe9e4202c5a0c92c564d3ac4a813fa61440384434cb054010", "ja": "（それから入口の案内所に向かうと、ちょうど\n女の子を探していたご家族と会うことができた……）", "zh": "（之后前往入口的服务台时，正好遇到了一家正在寻找小女孩的家庭……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1073_021mat", "source_sha256": "9ecdc9e568dcede26617678fee4275b06bb566c70905b74a9abf00c792f5c162", "ja": "これでひと安心なのです。\nお姉ちゃんの手を離しちゃ、めっ！なのですよ？", "zh": "这样就可以放心了。\n不可以放开姐姐的手哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1074_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "52148bd73706e04a15838b4b391261e2c22633a079e9a4aeb03d661532d9f04c", "ja": "うんっ！　ねえ……\nどこにいったら、またおひめさまに会える？", "zh": "嗯！那个……\n要去哪里，才能再次见到公主？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1075_021mat", "source_sha256": "351bff94946a0ae23fa87f71406dcfcdd685efe8356afd3fdea1d222994a34e3", "ja": "ほ？　姫に会いたいのです？　だったら……\n765プロライブ劇場で、いつでも会えるのですよ。", "zh": "哦？你想见公主吗？那样的话……在765现场剧场，随时都能见到哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1076_021mat", "source_sha256": "5080e55e0996a02d2f57bfc42720fe2f26463e3c5d8eb8dee3e64cd60e3c6c8b", "ja": "妖精さんやお友達が、たくさんいるのです。\n姫の大切なお城に、ご招待するのです♪", "zh": "那里有好多小妖精和好朋友哦。\n公主邀请你来我珍视的城堡玩♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1077_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "1d1af7349b9918241e74aa1be38fa37ac19a9b2e763cab85779a38f47ef1dcb0", "ja": "ほんと！？　ぜったい、やくそくだよ！", "zh": "真的吗！？一定要遵守约定哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1078_021mat", "source_sha256": "1f43c7d98db23b652c480fee21d48a94cd58b91267b07ced043cd532e6f6f4d9", "ja": "はい、約束なのです！　……世界で一番\nキラキラなお姫様の姿、見せてあげるからね。", "zh": "好，说定了哦！……会让你看看世界上最闪耀的公主模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1080_037nao", "source_sha256": "8b0dbb918a928d5457512eb7c6f7bde2b5e3661dccbb6ea8e9ab767e02e1c285", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　まつりー！\nやっと見つけたわ。あんな、あっちに面白い屋台が……", "zh": "{$P$}先生！茉莉——！\n终于找到你们了。我说啊，那边有个挺有意思的摊位……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1081_021mat", "source_sha256": "d01f2305a401c3728e63404b3b1c820ed6baa36abf6d411f2997412f1410f981", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん、奈緒ちゃん。\nアイディアは、もう十分なのです！", "zh": "小奈绪，小奈绪。\n点子已经完全足够了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1082_037nao", "source_sha256": "8a188f1b9df4ca3cf33bde93a2e1070872498fe7a4684e7435e23e489fb2a5de", "ja": "へ？　どういうこと？", "zh": "诶？这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1083_021mat", "source_sha256": "071c6bc6102714f425455c7210e6ea877d1dcf969bc777af8bab4240588c8bf7", "ja": "どんなにすごいアイディアがたくさんあっても……\n姫が、姫じゃないとダメだったのです。", "zh": "不管有多少厉害的点子……\n公主也必须是公主才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1084_021mat", "source_sha256": "b9f40b509cfabeb423f3cc23f48f44fd8494bd26fe1787e803234b966efe0699", "ja": "でも、みんなが考えてくれたアイディアは、\nとっても参考にさせてもらうのです。", "zh": "不过，大家为我想出的点子，我都会好好参考的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1085_021mat", "source_sha256": "9df15a54e8faa0c7cc278c125e9c3130680513acfd3e4c7ddc165cd085cb843e", "ja": "みんな、姫のためにいろいろ考えてくれて\n本当に本当にありがとうなのです！", "zh": "大家为公主想了这么多，真的真的谢谢你们哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1086_023aka", "source_sha256": "2717248ae8763c08b041f1f7e23338cefdb885662545067f03ee315e9d2dbfbc", "ja": "ってことは、まつりちゃん人形は？　着ぐるみは！？\n新作グッズで一儲けしようと思ってたのに～！", "zh": "这么说，茉莉小人偶呢？人偶装呢！？\n我还想着靠新出的周边大赚一笔呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1087_p", "source_sha256": "6b416ccf111006a86ca030fb5e6ba786ccae9736037c96759a5b44638b819701", "ja": "そんな事考えてたのか……。", "zh": "原来你在考虑这种事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1088_026yur", "source_sha256": "4ce80edbcf43804e4f63f8e8c3b511fc27c98b16651ec3efc18a3e459b8a5cea", "ja": "でも、いいと思います。信念を貫く\nお姫様の姿は、いつだって魅力的ですからね！", "zh": "不过，我觉得这样也很好。因为坚持贯彻信念的公主，无论何时都很有魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1089_002chi", "source_sha256": "93f0da5e85395bf7f336408df66dd51ee922383d54a8e88e13be39e5d891f802", "ja": "私も、徳川さんが決めた事ならそれでいいかと。\n徳川さんらしい曲……今から楽しみですね。", "zh": "既然是德川小姐决定的，那样就好。我很期待符合德川小姐风格的歌曲呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1090_037nao", "source_sha256": "bd196523c1a6ec43a2e7bbc0eb5ec32d1bba8b33ceaf9702faac9397da6695c4", "ja": "せやな、ちょっとでも役に立ったならよかったわ。\nアイディア出すんも、けっこう楽しかったしな！", "zh": "是啊，能帮上哪怕一点忙就太好了。\n而且出主意也挺开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1091_021mat", "source_sha256": "f7bac5c018e6d097cb5ba0a94e5785918b2d8232ab73a3226db4eaaf58030d38", "ja": "ちょっとどころか、とっても参考になったのです！\nではさっそく、劇場に戻って準備をするのですー！", "zh": "别说一点了，真是帮了大忙呢！\n那么，我们马上回剧场准备吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1092_026yur", "source_sha256": "56933cd5164af40a50729f54a65bf793f724b49b0e0a96f650deb8ba32958778", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\nまつりさん、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。\n茉莉小姐，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1093_002chi", "source_sha256": "b99182d1d820e90ce371f7280e0b1c7cdc6335688f5f105c4e1f38ec6242d4d4", "ja": "そうね。さっき、お祭りを見学していた時より、\nなんだかずっと楽しそう。", "zh": "是啊。和刚才参观庆典的时候相比，她好像一直都开心得多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1094_p", "source_sha256": "d464219087faf7a0d2cbeea4a95636f7c61bcc52dd8bb84828746410c0e37544", "ja": "まあ、色々な。\nとりあえず、今回はナイト様の出番はないらしい。", "zh": "哎，发生了挺多事的。\n总之，这次骑士大人似乎是派不上用场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1095_026yur", "source_sha256": "8f81061b53b04ba5f30cef0e33c2111b3736c0db26b56d30a4867fcf77373c2f", "ja": "ええっ、ナイト様！？　\nあの、それは一体……？", "zh": "诶诶，骑士大人！？  \n那个，这到底是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1096_021mat", "source_sha256": "fc8eb0720763e2b0fdff434dc372b3293391eec74600d1dd8dbbb6443834fb1b", "ja": "千早ちゃん、百合子ちゃん！\n{$P$}さんも、早くなのです！", "zh": "千早、百合子！  \n{$P$}先生也快点来呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1097_021mat", "source_sha256": "701e101b3bde1b195b047df7b26c5e81db9e92db5790a959b84183186f172b56", "ja": "見た人みんなが、はっぴー！になる、\n最高の曲とステージにするのですよ♪", "zh": "要让看到的每一个人都开心，打造最棒的歌曲和舞台哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_088_1098_p", "source_sha256": "ed5ebf89068692eb9635c9f6ca7bea8cea6c0ae8078cc74a0c7f4ec0eeb67ec0", "ja": "（たくさんの人に楽しんでもらえる、まつりらしい\nステージを作る。お姫様のステージの、開幕だ！）", "zh": "（打造一个能让许多人享受、充满祭风格的舞台。公主的舞台，现在开幕！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
